category: Utils
build-depends: cygport libcurl-devel libjson-c-devel
sdesc: "Terminal I/O logger (utilities)"
ldesc: "Tlog is a terminal I/O recording and playback package suitable for
implementing centralized user session recording. At the moment it is not ready
for production and is to be considered development preview quality."
